// SecretTombstone is the compact, permanent record left behind when a
// terminal secret is pruned at terminal_at + RetentionBlocks. It is the
// decided seven-field model (docs/planning/PENDING_TERMINAL_SECRET_RETENTION_PLAN.md §4):
// a verification anchor (the digest makes any archived copy of the full
// canonical record self-authenticating), identity for standalone attribution,
// and the one cryptographic anchor that enables archive-free verification of
// a reconstructed payload. Everything else about the secret is provable via
